{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》氣勢如虹劇力萬鈞，掀起一股追劇潮。</p><p>劇中，官孝賢（張智霖飾）與官孝君（吳卓羲飾）兩兄弟為家族接班人爭奪戰展開，掀起高潮。</p><p>Alice（高海寧飾）和Kate（張曦雯飾）決裂的閨密情同樣精彩絕倫。</p><p>《璀》首播後收視亦節節上升，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.479949+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:13:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:47:33.365930+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"80fc75f5f1d5db4d9874c20f067f2e167487dbca6cabc3a90fe57101cdb3736b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}